      "description": "Native connection disclosure; API tokens use a password field and provider sign-in stays in Music Assistant. Synthetic preview only.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-music\"><summary>Connect to Music Assistant</summary><p>Keep provider passwords in Music Assistant.</p><label>Music Assistant API token<input type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></label></details>",
